      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "arcane",
        "fire"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The fire scamp breathes flames in a 15ft Cone that deals 2d4 Fire Damage damage to each creature within the area (Basic DC 17 Reflex Saving Throw save). Creatures that fail the save also take 1d4 Persistent,fire Damage damage.</p>\n<p>The fire scamp can't use Flame Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
