          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "Basic will",
          "description": "<p>You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also Stunned 1.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p>",
